    "description": "<p><strong>Required Heroic Skill:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.heroic-skills.Item.FpTkfuZ5p4zCQKDP]</p><hr><p>You channel the fury of the planet into a powerful wave of fire and magma. Choose <strong>one</strong> option:</p><ul><li><p>You deal 50 <strong>fire</strong> damage to one creature you can see.</p></li><li><p>You deal 30 <strong>fire</strong> damage to every enemy you can see.</p></li></ul><p>These amounts increase by 5 if you are <strong>level 20 or higher</strong>, or by 10 if you are <strong>level 40 or higher</strong>.</p><p>Damage dealt by this spell ignores Resistances and Immunities.</p>",
